{"server":"tw","storyId":"act27side_level_act27side_08_end","groupId":"act27side","stageId":"act27side_08","title":"愛之歌","storyCode":"SL-8","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act27side/level_act27side_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"9c530d2140f8d13671e22f86ad6d916314393cec97dd9160167d24e1a05cb17a","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_i08"},{"type":"narration","text":"呼......很舒服的溫度。雖然溫泉也很有趣，但溫度還是太平和了。\n這樣的溫度可以讓我頭腦清醒，有助於我思考一些很重要的問題。\n比如說......世界上是先有岩漿，還是先有岩石？\n在最初的最初，“岩漿”並不是“岩漿”，“岩石”也不是“岩石”，物質在循環、轉化中分成了不同的樣貌，又被賦予了不同的名字。\n人們總是在嘗試用確定的語言框定世界根本無可描述的本質，彷彿只有這樣才能讓自己安心睡著一樣，這也是缺乏智慧的體現......\n嘿，小心點，不要把岩漿抖得到處都是，很危險。雖然機率很小，但萬一這時候有人路過——\n嗯？怎麼吵吵鬧鬧的......真的有人想加入我們？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g11_volcanomountainside"},{"type":"narration","text":"腳下巨大的怪物喘息越加沉重，周圍溫度又升高了不少。自火山口飛濺出的岩漿快速冷卻，化為堅硬的石塊翻滾而下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡恩前輩，凱勒老師......這裡很危險......我們還是，先離開......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_996_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿黛爾，你先離開，我一定要讓這個人交代清楚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":"avg_npc_999_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡恩，別犯蠢了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_996_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你當初把他們扔在烏納火山上的時候，他們面對的是比這更恐怖的景象......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_996_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還算有良心嗎凱勒，承認自己的罪行，比面對死亡還困難嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡恩前輩......快點離開......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可能擋不住下一波......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小心身後！"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿黛爾舉起了法杖，可落石如雨點般落下，她的源石技藝也來不及將它們一一熔化。\n她專注於保護同伴安全，卻偏偏沒有聽到旁邊的人的警告，也沒有聽到身後危險的響動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱勒","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g6_siestaunbuiltland_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"開朗的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1010_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"低落的小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這幾天，我好像一直能看到你，可別人好像都看不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"低落的小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然不知道你是從哪裡來的，但是只有你願意陪陪我了。我知道，你也喜歡吃草莓味的冰淇淋，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"開朗的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1010_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（順從地趴下）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"低落的小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，我們原來的家就在那座火山下面，可是它馬上就要消失不見了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"低落的小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我都知道，我是被扔在那裡，被哈莉和埃尼斯撿到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"低落的小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不知道自己為什麼會被丟下，可是我真正的爸爸媽媽要回來找我的話，他們還能找到我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"低落的小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......爸爸走了，埃尼斯也要走了，小毛羊你說，我們的家到底在哪裡呢？很久之前，和我一起吃草莓冰淇淋的那個朋友又在哪裡呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"開朗的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1010_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不滿的哼叫）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"低落的小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"海洋不會回應，一如既往地橫亙在兩個汐斯塔之間。\n女孩突然意識到，眼前風平浪靜的海岸線不知何時靠近了自己一點，海水漸漸沒過了乾燥的地面，蔓延到自己腳下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"低落的小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麗芙！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g11_volcanomountainside"},{"type":"narration","text":"周圍突然安靜了下來。\n沸騰的岩漿，滾落的山石，統統變得靜謐無聲，彷彿時間已經停滯。\n阿黛爾不確定是助聽器出了故障，還是自己又墜入夢境。她只覺得自己被無形的熱量包裹著，像是跌入了溫暖的床褥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可憐的小傢伙，好像被嚇了一跳。唉，為什麼要趕在這個時候上火山呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多利先生？您原來在這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為您已經離開了......凱勒老師和卡恩前輩在哪裡？！火山上的異常反應是小羊們造成的嗎？我......我是不是已經死了......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，嘿！冷靜一點小傢伙，我知道你有很多問題想問，別著急，一個一個來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還好好活著，和你一起來的同伴也是，不過我不會讓他們看到我。等他們醒來後，也只會覺得自己做了一場夢吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於山上那些奇奇怪怪的設備......我很抱歉，我告訴過他們要小心點的——這次是真的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他們玩得開心的時候我從來管不住他們......這個也是真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在火山上......玩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然！我不是說過，這是讓我第二開心的事，火山衝浪！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿黛爾抬頭遠望，火山口的岩漿不規則地湧動著，隱約可以看到其中活躍歡樂的身影。同時還有更多的生物開心地向火山口奔湧而去。\n滿山遍野的白色絨毛，像是天上落下的雲朵，細密地蓋在山坡上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多利先生，這些小羊，它們不只是分身吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔喔，你已經注意到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像我之前說的，在過去漫長的時間裡，我見過許多有趣的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，別誤會，這不是“靈魂”什麼的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"消失的生命本身無法留存下來，我只是模仿他們的樣子，捏造了這樣一個個小生物......算是一種個人收藏？我還以為你們會喜歡來著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總感覺......有些殘忍呢......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛聊了這麼多，我才發現，看來最後一樣“皮毛”你也已經找到了。嗯......的確是好久都沒有見到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"陳舊的防護服上，就在剛剛，又多了一道疤痕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我應該猜到的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很明確的比喻，對吧。動物是需要厚厚的皮毛來保護自己的——人也一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看見你站在這，我就像看到了我的那兩位老朋友。我也十分想念他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，我可不會誇獎你繼承了他們了不起的衣缽。只是我猜，你也很想他們。可憐的孩子，為什麼不能大大方方地承認呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用逞強，也不用把自己繃得那麼緊。沒有誰會不允許一個像你這麼大的孩子難過或害怕，你也應該學著別太逞強。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感到疲憊的話，就停下來休息休息，或者大哭一場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多利先生，這個“尋寶遊戲”，就是單純的遊戲嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"確實不是什麼神秘的謎題，我只是希望你能玩得開心，阿黛爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在汐斯塔玩鬧的這段日子，我很開心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不明白，您為什麼會特地關照我呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很簡單，畢竟這世上像你這樣可愛的女孩可不多見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然不幸總是找上你......但你擁有的愛一點也不比別人少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實，在很久以前，在萊塔尼亞的時候，我就見過你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在一座小小的高塔裡，永遠在認真看書的女孩。\n作為那對天才學者的孩子而被寄予期待，被看作有天賦的術師、學者。\n這樣優秀、傑出的人才，總被期待著達到與天賦相配的成就，哪怕感染絕症，也只被人當作堅強的榜樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小阿黛爾，有沒有人問過你，你自己的願望是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，這世上有那麼多人，有那麼多樣的人生。你很瞭解火山，可是在火山之外還有那麼多有趣的事物，為什麼不多去看看呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝您......多利先生。這幾天，我很開心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聞到了一半謊言的味道，一小半，不過就先這樣吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"時間差不多了，雖然很想邀請你一起來岩漿衝浪，但人類的身體還是太弱小了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我送你們去安全點的地方，然後我就要迎接火山樂園的開幕了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再見，阿黛爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，多利先生......我們還會再見嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能吧......不，應該說，我們總會再見面的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望下次見面的時候，我能看到一個真正開心的阿黛爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說好了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"柔軟的生物抖了抖身體，向前挪動幾步，用吻部輕輕碰了碰女孩的臉頰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！差點忘了，你找到了三樣東西，我也該給出我的報酬了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多利先生，關於我父母的死......你還知道些什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的意思是......你一直要找的，不是“火山預警花”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您說的報酬，是指火山預警花？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"驚......驚喜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來在汐斯塔火山的山坡上，生長著許多火山預警花。長得很好看，也很好吃。所以被那些小傢伙吃掉了不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後來我意識到，這樣下去用不了多久，這點花就會被吃光的。於是我瞞著他們，在一個隱秘的地方偷偷種了一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來火山預警花還沒有絕跡啊，這也的確是個好消息......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼現在剩下的花，種在哪裡呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，就在火山的後山坡上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿黛爾","speakerId":"avg_1016_agoat2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是這座，馬上就要爆發的火山嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多利","speakerId":"avg_npc_1014_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......是的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g6_siestaunbuiltland_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃尼斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是......要走了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（氣喘吁吁）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼......一個人跑出來了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為......你不會再回來了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"開什麼玩笑......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"探險小隊......不是說好要一起行動的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們回家。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"海水已經沒過了腳踝，行走也變得步履維艱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......快走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"海浪起初只是視野盡頭模糊的一條線，轉瞬又近在眼前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"埃尼斯緊緊將妹妹護在身下，海浪拍打在他並不強壯的脊背上，埃尼斯一個趔趄。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"又一道更高的浪潮拍來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（實在沒有辦法了......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（試試這個——）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"埃尼斯努力感受著身體裡的“石頭”，它離心臟很近。心臟的每一次跳動都能感受到那堅硬的質感。\n一人高的土石拔地而起，擋在兄妹二人身前，在勉強擋下浪潮後又頃刻瓦解。\n心口傳來一陣劇痛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃尼斯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看......我說過......哥哥會變魔術吧......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"埃尼斯一把抹掉臉上的血跡，拉住妹妹免得她被崩碎的土石砸到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快，躲到我身後！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_i09"},{"type":"narration","text":"一隻、兩隻......\n像是白色的浪花變成的，無數隻毛絨絨的生物從海岸遠方奔來，層層疊起，排成了一堵牆，一座堤壩。\n海浪拍打在毛絨堤壩上，下一秒便被盡數吸收。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我一定是瘋了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這些是什麼東西......"},{"type":"narration","text":"白色的絨毛浸滿了海水後變得更加膨大，牢牢將危險的波浪與兩人隔絕開來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"不知過去了多久，地面終於不再搖晃，海浪漸漸平息了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g6_siestaunbuiltland_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"得......得救了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷糊的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1012_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（晃動身體）（抖水）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝......謝謝？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷糊的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1012_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（歡快的叫聲）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"就像是棉花糖融化在水裡，小獸忽然間消失不見了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這可能......是人生跑馬燈吧......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃尼斯！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g2_siestacommercialstreet_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"夜幕漸深，不知從何時開始，熙熙攘攘的人群中喧囂聲漸漸小了下來。\n有人拿出吉他，彈起了安靜的旋律。\n彷彿是某種默契，人們都向一個相同的地方望去。\n一縷灰煙從火山口緩緩升起，隨後是噴薄著的暗紅和灰黑，大地在微微震動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"忐忑的路人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們到了這個距離，確定不會被波及吧......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遺憾的路人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，還是要來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樂器店男老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1000_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......真的爆發了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"樂器店女老闆","speakerId":"avg_npc_1001_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"人們不約而同地握住身邊人的雙手，父母抱緊孩子，行人摒住呼吸。\n彷彿是懸著的心終於放下，又像是一塊巨石終於砸到了心口，人群中傳來幾聲嘆息，夾雜著低低的交談，卻又讓整條街道變得更加安靜。\n直到很久，很久，人們從眼前的景象回過神來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記得小的時候......父母帶著我，去爬了一座小山。那個山上長滿了我不知道名字的花樹，一棵一棵的，每年春天都特別香。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......父親對花粉過敏，只在山下等著，我和母親折了花枝，編成花環，在山上跑啊，跑啊，衝著山下揮手......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......再也不會有了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1005_1","isRemote":false,"text":"湯姆爺爺......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼，孩子，只是想起一些過去的事情......之前每天賣冰淇淋，認識了不少小朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的孩子們也都在哥倫比亞，這個時候，也沒來得及回來一趟......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"avg_npc_990_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"avg_npc_990_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老先生，您的孩子在國外，有可能還不知道汐斯塔的火山會在今天爆發，也有可能他們就在路上，或者是包裹還在中轉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"avg_npc_990_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來這裡，其實也是希望能建立連接各個地區的物流中心，讓每個地方的距離都縮短一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"avg_npc_990_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許以後，您在家中就能很快地收到來自各個地方的東西，您的孩子也能更快地知道您的近況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"avg_npc_990_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是這些都還很遠......我剛才在想，我也可以做點什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"avg_npc_990_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老先生，只要是給在其他地方的親人們寄的明信片，在這幾天，峯聯貿易可以免費寄送。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"avg_npc_990_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等他們收到，或者收到後願意回來看看，那個時候的汐斯塔，會是一個更好的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拜松","speakerId":"avg_npc_990_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也會盡我最大的努力，讓這裡變得更好——除了商業之外，這也是我的一點小小心願。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，多謝你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1005_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能給親人寄信......真好呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1005_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在哥倫比亞上學的時候，有時候夜裡會突然想家，想寄點什麼，但又付不起跨國的郵寄費用，就在被子裡偷偷哭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1005_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那時就想起學過的詩句，意思是，不管人們身處何方，但天上的雙月是一樣的。只要我們都看著月亮，再遠的距離，都好像沒有了一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雪雉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1005_1","isRemote":false,"text":"汐斯塔有什麼，類似於這種感覺的歌嗎......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"老人清了清嗓子，鬍子微微顫抖，他像是回憶起了什麼，有些不熟練地唱起一首歌。\n火山灰逐漸彌漫，蔭蔽住大半的天空。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我每天在理想旁徘徊♪"},{"type":"narration","text":"迷失了方向，像羽獸不會飛翔♪\n我只好抓住希望，堅持到底♪\n我擔心會在路上跌倒♪\n也害怕看不見明天的太陽♪\n我要去遠方，不是去流浪♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我要去遠方，不是去流浪♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰品店店主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那裡是我......一直尋找的地方♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g2_siestacommercialstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1003_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑！怎麼是你？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島有一些任務，我處理完就立刻趕過來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在人群裡找了半天，總算找到你了。包裡還有你喜歡的紅茶，回去以後拿給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"avg_340_shwaz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最後，我也想趕回來看看......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_i10"},{"type":"narration","text":"他們看到記憶裡的山岩崩落，又看到一道從未見過的壯麗晚霞從山口升起。\n粉色的煙塵遮住了半邊天空，又緩緩落回地面。雖然無法看到，但人們知道，有一段獨屬於他們的回憶，被永遠埋在了純白的火山灰下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚訝的路人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我是不是眼花了......火山山頭，怎麼變成了白色？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的路人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你在說什麼？我沒看到啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遺憾的路人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"汐斯塔......還是毀滅了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不再慌張的路人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得，應該說是新生才對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"不再慌張的路人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我建議以後我們應該紀念這一天......就叫火山節怎麼樣？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"希望你每天晚上都可以平和地進入夢鄉♪\n\\n\\n不用憂愁，不用著急♪\n過去的會過去，未來會如約到來♪\n\\n\\n太陽會照常升起，幸福會如約來臨♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再見，汐斯塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再見......汐斯塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......別難過，小姐。明天會是新的一天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對啊......明天會是新的一天。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g11_volcanomountainside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿！該死的羊崽子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"把你的嘴......從我的黑膠唱片上......挪開！也不准咬我的限量版衣服！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"小心岩漿！該死，高溫會影響唱片的音質的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"你以為這樣就能耗光我的耐心嗎，別傻了，我可以和你耗上一萬年......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大帝","speakerId":"char_105_emper","isRemote":false,"text":"多利！我發誓要抓你的這些分身去餵狼......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_105_emper","aliases":["大帝"]}]}
